[00:09.34]1. The living God, Jehovah, you have proved to be;
[00:18.68]Your mighty works abound
[00:28.03]in earth and sky and sea.
[00:37.37]No rival god can equal what you have done
[00:44.59]—there is none.
[00:55.59]Our foes will be consumed.
[01:00.48](Chorus)
[01:06.45]Jehovah provides escape for the loyal.
[01:12.42]His servants will see what a mighty Crag is he.
[01:18.38]So with courage and faith in our God,
[01:22.47]we spread the fame
[01:26.57]Of Jehovah, our Source of escape,
[01:30.66]and praise his name.
[01:52.89]2. Though ropes of death encircle me, I call to you,
[02:01.53]“Jehovah, give me strength,
[02:05.81]and give me courage too.”
[02:10.65]From your own temple dwelling, you hear my plea,
[02:14.31]“Shelter me;
[02:17.97]Rescue me, O my God.”
[02:25.21](Chorus)
[02:32.46]Jehovah provides escape for the loyal.
[02:39.70]His servants will see what a mighty Crag is he.
[02:46.94]So with courage and faith in our God,
[02:54.81]we spread the fame
[03:01.72]Of Jehovah, our Source of escape,
[03:05.22]and praise his name.
[03:29.18]3. From heaven you will thunder
[03:33.47]and give forth your voice.
[03:37.76]Your enemies will quake;
[03:42.04]your servants will rejoice.
[03:46.04]You prove to be whatever you need to be;
[03:50.04]all will see
[03:54.04]How you provide escape.
[04:03.23](Chorus)
[04:12.41]Jehovah provides escape for the loyal.
[04:21.59]His servants will see what a mighty Crag is he.
[04:30.78]So with courage and faith in our God,
[04:39.96]we spread the fame
[04:49.14]Of Jehovah, our Source of escape,
[04:58.33]and praise his name.